silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_03_typed_verb_discipline_sections_04_symmetric_verb_cheese_trap_concrete_anchor_1_v_sym#issiblingofarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The IsSiblingOfArrow is the surface-symmetric verb 'is sibling of'. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'v_sym', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
